# Rust
/target
**/target
Cargo.lock.bak

# Downloaded ONNX embedding/reranker models (fastembed cache — liberado-memory-store,
# liberado-memory-mcp), re-downloaded on demand, not source
.fastembed_cache/
**/.fastembed_cache/

# Machine-local daemon state (Decision 12 trace sink, idempotency markers)
.liberado/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Sub-repos (standalone git repos nested inside this repo)
/turbomcp/
/turbovault/

# Not-for-deploy scratch (subagent-manager: operator directive — do not deploy)
/subagent-manager-mcp-master/
/subagent-manager-mcp-master.zip

# Local configuration overrides (committed starters live in config.example/ and crates/*/config.example/)
config/*.toml
crates/*/config/*.toml

.kilo
.codex/

# Ad-hoc daemon run logs from dev scripts (start-dev-stack.ps1 etc.)
tmp-liberado-*.log
tmp-liberado-*.log.prev

# cargo-mutants working dir (mutation testing scratch)
mutants.out*/

*.secret

# Working notes that are deliberately not history: they snapshot in-progress state (including which
# fixes the deployed box is still missing), so committing one publishes a to-do list of live gaps.
docs/future-work/session-profiles-next-actions.md

# cargo-mutants run output — local evidence, regenerated per run, not source.
mutants-core.txt
mutants-output.txt
mutants.out*/
